        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tomatoes conventional, hors-sol heated, at greenhouse, late harvest</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tomatoes conventional, hors-sol heated, at greenhouse, late harvest
The inventory refers to the production of 1kg of fresh tomato in a heated greenhouse in Switzerland. For late harvest, planting occurs in the beginning of March, the cultivation period lasts until mid-October.
nan
Location: The inventory is modelled for Switzerland
Technology: nan
Time period: nan
Production volume: nan
Sampling: Literature and data from producer
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3c0a4398-92c4-3e59-8b1d-f9a871df2f89.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
